      <body><head><ref target="https://papyri.info/editions/o.wilck/1217" n="94828"><title>O.Wilck. 2 1217</title><date>1899</date></ref></head><div xml:lang="grc" type="edition" xml:space="preserve"><ab>
    <lb n="1"/>τῷ κυρίῳ μου Πλῆνις 

    <lb n="2"/><app type="editorial"><lem resp="N. Gonis, APF 64 (2018) 57"><expan>Ἀλαβῶν<ex>ος</ex></expan></lem><rdg>Α<gap reason="illegible" quantity="2" unit="character"/>ω<gap reason="illegible" quantity="2" unit="character"/></rdg></app> Παῆρις <expan>νεώτ<ex>ερος</ex></expan> 

    <lb n="3"/>Πεκῦσις καὶ <app type="editorial"><lem resp="N. Gonis, APF 64 (2018) 57"><expan>κοι<ex>νωνοὶ</ex></expan></lem><rdg><choice><reg><expan>βοη<ex>θοὶ</ex></expan></reg><orig><expan>βοι<ex>θοὶ</ex></expan></orig></choice></rdg></app> <expan>σίτ<ex>ου</ex></expan> 

    <lb n="4"/><choice><reg>ἀποδέκτης</reg><orig>ἀποτέκτης</orig></choice>. περὶ τοῦ 

    <lb n="5"/>σίτου, ἃ ἐμέτρησεν 

    <lb n="6"/>Ἇτερ καὶ Νεβτῖχος 

    <lb n="7"/><gap reason="illegible" quantity="2" unit="character"/>ς <choice><reg>δὸς</reg><orig>δὼς</orig></choice> <choice><reg>ἀποχὴν</reg><orig>ἀποχὴ</orig></choice> 

